The first publish of a service creates its folders and the collection's
note, with a figure for each photo, captions escaped.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 10,
			"path": [
				"Recent"
			]
		}
	],
	"collection": 10,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "A1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/1.jpg",
			"caption": "Sunset *over* the lake\n#1"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "B2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/2.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- render/1.jpg --
full 1 new
-- render/2.jpg --
full 2 new
-- vault/Welcome.md --
Hello
-- want/response.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "A1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
			"remoteId": "a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "B2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
			"remoteId": "b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- want/log --
Recent: stored 2 of 2 photos
created Galleries/Recent.md with 2 photos
-- want/vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg --
full 1 new
-- want/vault/.vaultsite/fullsize/cat/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
full 2 new
-- want/vault/Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg --
thumb of full 1 new
-- want/vault/Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg --
thumb of full 2 new
-- want/vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Sunset \*over\* the lake \#1

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002)
-- want/vault/Welcome.md --
Hello
